program	conformance/M12_varself_method_through_shared_ref.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot call `&var self` method `bump` on immutable variable `c`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot call `&var self` method `bump` on immutable variable `c`"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/M12_varself_method_through_shared_ref.saw:11:18"
log	"     |"
log	" 11 | func f(c: &C) { c.bump() }"
log	"     |                  ^"
log	"   hint: consider using `var` instead of `let` to make it mutable"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
